  "word_count": 108,
  "text_content": "Mama washed the family clothes and pegged them on the line to dry. Tunde was playing football near the house. Suddenly, the sky grew dark and a strong breeze began to blow. Tunde heard the distant rumble of thunder beyond the hills. He stopped his game at once and raced to the line. Quickly, he gathered every shirt, dress and towel into a bundle. Just as he reached the door, heavy rain began to pour. Mama came out and saw the dry clothes piled in his arms. She hugged him tightly and called him her little helper. When the storm had passed, Tunde returned to his football match.",
